      "text": "Then clouds covered the sun, and her beam faded. Aria felt discouraged, but remembered the village children sharing lanterns on dark evenings. Perhaps the castle needed light that came from caring, not showing off."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "beat": "climax",
      "title": "A Light Worth Sharing",
      "description": "Aria offering a firefly shelter inside the lantern as the door opens.",
