      "text": "A firefly rested beneath a leaf. Aria gently opened her lantern and offered shelter. The firefly glowed inside, and the castle doors swung wide. The magical sword shone nearby, recognizing her patient and generous heart."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "beat": "resolution",
      "title": "The Song Returns",
      "description": "Aria carrying the glowing sword toward the village as shadows retreat.",
      "characters": [
        "Aria"
      ],
      "text": "Aria carried the sword home, using its gentle light to guide neighbors through the shadows. The castle began singing again. Everyone called her brave, but Aria knew the smallest kindness had opened the biggest door."
    }
  ]
